  "content": "\n\n# ✨ 平滑 GUI\n\n* 打开 GUI 时提供平滑的滑入动画。\n* GUI 背景遮罩渐显。\n* 背景模糊渐显。\n* 可通过配置文件自定义动画效果。\n* 在 Fabric 平台上，可借助 [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) 进行模组配置。\n\n<div>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/smooth-gui/versions?l=fabric\">\n    <img alt=\"Fabric 下载\" height=\"54\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fnpm%2F%40intergrav%2Fdevins-badges%403%2Fassets%2Fcozy%2Fsupported%2Ffabric_vector.svg&amp;n=-1\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/smooth-gui/versions?l=neoforge\">\n    <img alt=\"NeoForge 下载\" height=\"54\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fgh%2FHyperbole-Devs%2Fvectors%40neoforge_badges%2Fassets%2Fcozy%2Fsupported%2Fneoforge_vector.svg&amp;n=-1\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/smooth-gui/versions?l=forge\">\n    <img alt=\"Forge 下载\" height=\"54\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fgh%2FHyperbole-Devs%2Fvectors%40neoforge_badges%2Fassets%2Fcozy%2Fsupported%2Fforge_vector.svg&amp;n=-1\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<img width=\"80%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/j6yrZogB/images/ac59fa07db4e35433a7f5434e32ddbb7f2a17b8f.gif\"></img>\n\n<img width=\"80%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/j6yrZogB/images/3fba4f2a094ec89e8962ca5df83a2a1ff87b8519.png\"></img>\n\n<br>\n\n查看我的其他模组：[Chat Animation](https://modrinth.com/mod/chatanimation)",
